      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good afternoon, everybody. Welcome back. Madam Registrar, if you could kindly call the case, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "THE REGISTRAR",
      "role": "registrar",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good afternoon, Your Honours. This is case number IT-05-88-T, the Prosecutor versus Vujadin Popovic et al."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE AGIUS",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "I thank you, ma'am. For the record, all the accused are present. There is a rearrangement amongst the Defence teams. I just want to make sure everyone is present. Everyone seems to be present. And from the Prosecution it's Mr. McCloskey and Ms. Janisiewicz. No one else behind the curtains. For the record also, the witness's counsel is also present. And I think we can now safely go into closed session and we can start."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "JUDGE AGIUS",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Wednesday, the 10th day of October, 2007, at 2.15 p.m."
    }
  ],
